/* rofi settings for this machine only.
 *
 * Created once and never rewritten; nothing here is tracked. Imported LAST, and
 * rofi takes the last definition it reads, so anything here overrides the
 * repository's theme. That ordering was measured with `rofi -dump-theme`, not
 * assumed.
 *
 *     * { background-color: #202020; }
 *     window { width: 60%; }
 *
 * Ask rofi what it actually applied rather than reading this back:
 *
 *     rofi -dump-theme     the resolved theme, after every import
 *     rofi -dump-config    the resolved configuration
 *
 * Colours come from the selected theme and are regenerated on every switch, so
 * a colour set here will win but will also stop tracking the theme. Usually the
 * thing you want is `theme` instead.
 */
